# Whitelist: nothing in fh1/ is tracked unless named here, so game data can't be committed by accident.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!docs/
docs/*
!docs/*.md
!pipeline/
pipeline/*
!pipeline/*.py
!pipeline/*.lua
!pipeline/lzx.c
!pipeline/fh1radio_app/
pipeline/fh1radio_app/*
!pipeline/fh1radio_app/app.js
!pipeline/fh1radio_app/app.json
!fm4/
fm4/*
!fm4/*.py
